{"kp_id": "zj-028.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-028", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "三阴交为妇科大穴，妇女可常灸；中年后亦宜重视。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp6"], "chapter_id": "zj-028.c01", "evidence_quote": "三阴交是妇科的大穴", "seg_from": 5, "seg_to": 6, "start_s": 30.6, "end_s": 46.58, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nQ1Fyxd_q8o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQ1Fyxd_q8o&t=30s", "series": "zj", "episode": 28, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 28", "start_s": 30.6, "end_s": 46.58}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-028.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-028", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "漏谷约在三阴交上三寸，为脾经与胃经表里联络处。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp7", "acupoint.sp6", "meridian.sp", "meridian.st"], "chapter_id": "zj-028.c01", "evidence_quote": "三阴交再上三寸嘛", "seg_from": 31, "seg_to": 32, "start_s": 187.73, "end_s": 220.37, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nQ1Fyxd_q8o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQ1Fyxd_q8o&t=187s", "series": "zj", "episode": 28, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 28", "start_s": 187.73, "end_s": 220.37}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "露骨/肉骨=漏谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-028.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-028", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "双侧三阴交、地机、阴陵泉合用专治水肿；起针时常有水液外渗（非刺破血管之血）。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp6", "acupoint.sp8", "acupoint.sp9", "symptom.shui_zhong"], "chapter_id": "zj-028.c01", "evidence_quote": "专门治疗什么水肿", "seg_from": 92, "seg_to": 100, "start_s": 483.87, "end_s": 538.87, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nQ1Fyxd_q8o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQ1Fyxd_q8o&t=483s", "series": "zj", "episode": 28, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 28", "start_s": 483.87, "end_s": 538.87}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "地基=地机；阴宁泉=阴陵泉", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-028.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-028", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "阴陵泉为合穴属水，大穴；主膝痛、脾湿、风湿、水肿及小便频数/失禁等。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp9"], "chapter_id": "zj-028.c01", "evidence_quote": "阴宁泉呢这个穴道是一个大穴", "seg_from": 119, "seg_to": 128, "start_s": 632.49, "end_s": 698.555, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nQ1Fyxd_q8o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQ1Fyxd_q8o&t=632s", "series": "zj", "episode": 28, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 28", "start_s": 632.49, "end_s": 698.55}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "阴宁泉/阴茎=阴陵泉；和穴=合穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-028.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-028", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "宜常灸三阴交、关元；男人尤宜常灸足三里，以免五十后夜尿增多。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp6", "acupoint.cv4", "acupoint.st36"], "chapter_id": "zj-028.c01", "evidence_quote": "尤其男人要多久足三里", "seg_from": 131, "seg_to": 131, "start_s": 713.66, "end_s": 725.48, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nQ1Fyxd_q8o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQ1Fyxd_q8o&t=713s", "series": "zj", "episode": 28, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 28", "start_s": 713.66, "end_s": 725.48}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "多久=多灸", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-028.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-028", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "针之深浅依病位：皮肤病宜浅，抽筋等筋病须入筋，勿一律深透。", "entity_ids": ["method.zhen_jiu"], "chapter_id": "zj-028.c01", "evidence_quote": "治疗皮肤表面的病，你心知道他是皮肤病", "seg_from": 159, "seg_to": 161, "start_s": 863.08, "end_s": 878.28, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nQ1Fyxd_q8o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQ1Fyxd_q8o&t=863s", "series": "zj", "episode": 28, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 28", "start_s": 863.08, "end_s": 878.28}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-028.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-028", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "血海治月经过多、闭经或漏下不止；配三阴交、中极可治诸痛经。宜浅刺（约一寸），勿过深。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.sp10", "acupoint.sp6", "acupoint.cv3"], "chapter_id": "zj-028.c02", "evidence_quote": "月经来太多或者月经不来，你都可以在血海上下针", "seg_from": 184, "seg_to": 213, "start_s": 1016.2, "end_s": 1188.957, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nQ1Fyxd_q8o", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQ1Fyxd_q8o&t=1016s", "series": "zj", "episode": 28, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 28", "start_s": 1016.2, "end_s": 1188.96}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
